{"meta":{"ui":"itinerary","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"notation","turn":"generate","prompt":"Plan two days in Kyoto as an inline itinerary: a timeline per day with times, places, how to get between them and how long it takes. Each stop expands for details, each day has a checklist of things to book that I can tick off, and a line at the top says how many are left.","text":"Card gap:12 pad:16 w:390\n  Text.title \"Kyoto: two days\"\n  state booked=0\n  state todo1=false\n  state todo2=false\n  state todo3=false\n  state todo4=false\n  state todo5=false\n  Text.muted \"Things to book left: {5-booked}\"\n  Text.heading \"Day 1: Higashiyama\"\n  Column gap:8\n    ExpansionTile \"08:30  Fushimi Inari Taisha\"\n      Text.body \"Walk through the torii gates up Mount Inari, about 2 hours round trip. Arrive early to avoid crowds.\"\n      Text.small \"Getting there: JR Nara Line to Inari Station, 5 min walk from Kyoto Station (about 5 min).\"\n    ExpansionTile \"11:00  Kiyomizu-dera\"\n      Text.body \"Hillside temple with a wooden stage over the valley. Allow 90 minutes.\"\n      Text.small \"Getting there: bus 206 from Inari area to Kiyomizu-michi, then 10 min uphill walk (about 35 min).\"\n    ExpansionTile \"13:30  Ninenzaka and Sannenzaka\"\n      Text.body \"Preserved stone lanes lined with teahouses and craft shops, leading down from Kiyomizu.\"\n      Text.small \"Getting there: 10 min downhill walk from Kiyomizu-dera (about 10 min).\"\n    ExpansionTile \"16:00  Gion district\"\n      Text.body \"Traditional wooden machiya streets. Best in the early evening for a chance to glimpse geiko and maiko.\"\n      Text.small \"Getting there: 15 min walk along Shirakawa canal (about 15 min).\"\n  Text.strong \"Day 1 checklist\"\n  Column gap:6\n    Checkbox \"Book Kiyomizu-dera evening illumination (seasonal)\" =todo1 -> booked=booked+(todo1?1:-1)\n    Checkbox \"Reserve a kaiseki dinner in Gion\" =todo2 -> booked=booked+(todo2?1:-1)\n  Text.heading \"Day 2: Arashiyama and north\"\n  Column gap:8\n    ExpansionTile \"08:00  Arashiyama Bamboo Grove\"\n      Text.body \"Walk the towering bamboo path early before tour groups arrive. Allow 45 minutes.\"\n      Text.small \"Getting there: JR Sagano Line from Kyoto Station to Saga-Arashiyama (about 15 min).\"\n    ExpansionTile \"09:30  Tenryu-ji\"\n      Text.body \"UNESCO temple with a famous garden of borrowed scenery. Allow 60 minutes.\"\n      Text.small \"Getting there: 5 min walk from the bamboo grove (about 5 min).\"\n    ExpansionTile \"11:30  Kinkaku-ji (Golden Pavilion)\"\n      Text.body \"Gold-leafed pavilion reflected in a pond. Allow 60 minutes.\"\n      Text.small \"Getting there: bus 205 or 101 from Arashiyama, about 30 min.\"\n    ExpansionTile \"14:00  Nishiki Market\"\n      Text.body \"Narrow covered market for street food and local snacks. Allow 90 minutes.\"\n      Text.small \"Getting there: bus 205 to Shijo Karasuma, then 5 min walk (about 35 min).\"\n  Text.strong \"Day 2 checklist\"\n  Column gap:6\n    Checkbox \"Book Kinkaku-ji entry time slot\" =todo3 -> booked=booked+(todo3?1:-1)\n    Checkbox \"Reserve Arashiyama train tickets (IC card works)\" =todo4 -> booked=booked+(todo4?1:-1)\n    Checkbox \"Book Tenryu-ji garden entry\" =todo5 -> booked=booked+(todo5?1:-1)","usage":{"input_tokens":1534,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1315,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard","output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0}},"ttftMs":567,"totalMs":6582}}
